---
globs: **/*.csproj,**/*.fsproj,**/*.vbproj,**/*.sln,**/*.props,**/*.targets,Directory.Build.props,Directory.Build.targets,Directory.Packages.props,global.json,nuget.config,appsettings*.json
alwaysApply: false
---
# .NET project + config files

- Make the smallest necessary edits; avoid reordering/rewriting whole files.
- Prefer centrally-managed versions if the repo uses Directory.Packages.props / central package management.
- Avoid broad package upgrades unless explicitly requested.
- Call out any runtime/framework/SDK version implications (global.json, TargetFramework changes).
- Never embed secrets in appsettings; use user-secrets/env vars/secret stores.

